OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1785338294
OL,3,CExpectant mum 'shocked' at maternity
OL,4,Cunit closure
OL,6,FA pregnant woman has told ITV News
OL,7,Fthat she is "shocked" that the
OL,8,Fmaternity unit where she was due to
OL,9,Fgive birth is being closed due to
OL,10,Fsafety concerns.
OL,12,FNorth Devon District Hospital (NDDH),
OL,13,Fin Barnstaple, Devon, is planning to
OL,14,Ftemporarily close its maternity unit
OL,15,Fon 11 August due to "critical
OL,16,Fworkforce shortages."
OL,18,FLouisa Hockin, whose baby is due at
OL,19,Fthe start of September, said: "It's
OL,20,Fjust been quite a shock really to find
OL,21,Fout on social media.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1785338294
OL,3,CExpectant mum 'shocked' at maternity
OL,4,Cunit closure
OL,6,F"With only 5-weeks left til my due
OL,7,Fdate, it's just the uncertainty,
OL,8,Freally. There are already so many
OL,9,Funknowns when it comes to birth. So,
OL,10,Fjust knowing where you're going to
OL,11,Fgive birth is helpful."
OL,13,FThe Royal Devon University Healthcare
OL,14,FNHS Foundation Trust, which runs the
OL,15,Fhospital, said a review of medical
OL,16,Fstaffing levels found the unit can't
OL,17,Foperate safely.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1785338294
OL,3,CExpectant mum 'shocked' at maternity
OL,4,Cunit closure
OL,6,FMs Hockin added: "Exeter is around an
OL,7,Fhour and a half away, depending on
OL,8,Ftraffic. So if there are complications
OL,9,For something that is quite a way to
OL,10,Fgo, compared with Barnstaple, which is
OL,11,Fonly 20 minutes away.
OL,13,F"I have thought about other options,
OL,14,Fbut for me personally, with my first
OL,15,Fchild, I'd rather be safe in hospital.
OL,16,FI'm quite a laid-back, chilled person,
OL,17,Fbut this is a bit of a worry. It's
OL,18,Fjust the unknown of what is going to
OL,19,Fhappen."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1785338294
OL,3,CExpectant mum 'shocked' at maternity
OL,4,Cunit closure
OL,6,FChief medical officer Dr Vanessa
OL,7,FPurday said the trust will be getting
OL,8,Fin contact with expectant women in
OL,9,Forder of delivery date to discuss
OL,10,Fplans and ensure support is available.
OL,12,FShe said: "We recognise the impact and
OL,13,Fthe anxiety that will cause our
OL,14,Ffamilies and our women in North Devon.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1785338294
OL,3,CExpectant mum 'shocked' at maternity
OL,4,Cunit closure
OL,6,F"We will be reaching out individually
OL,7,Fto all our expectant women in North
OL,8,FDevon so we can put in place a
OL,9,Fpersonalised plan for each woman
OL,10,Fdepending on where they live, their
OL,11,Fown needs, and their own clinical
OL,12,Fsituation.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1785338294
OL,3,CExpectant mum 'shocked' at maternity
OL,4,Cunit closure
OL,6,F"What we will put in place with each
OL,7,Fwoman is an individual plan to
OL,8,Funderstand where is best for them to
OL,9,Fdeliver. In many cases, that will be
OL,10,FExeter, but not necessarily, depending
OL,11,Fon where they live and their
OL,12,Fgeography, so we are working with our
OL,13,Fneighbouring trust to make sure we
OL,14,Fprovide the best and safest service
OL,15,Ffor all our women."
OL,17,FDr Purday added: "The expectation is
OL,18,Fthat we will, of course, keep as much
OL,19,Fof our service running locally in
OL,20,FNorth Devon as we can.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1785338294
OL,3,CExpectant mum 'shocked' at maternity
OL,4,Cunit closure
OL,6,F"I want to assure women that access to
OL,7,Fthe community midwifery service and
OL,8,Fthe triage service will remain
OL,9,Funchanged. So, if you have any
OL,10,Fclinical concerns, reduced movements,
OL,11,Fyou're going into labour, or you think
OL,12,Fyou are, please reach out to us, and
OL,13,Fwe will support you."
OL,15,FDr Purday said the decision to close
OL,16,Fthe maternity unit "was not taken
OL,17,Flightly," and was necessary due to
OL,18,F"critical workforce shortages for our
OL,19,Fsenior medical workforce."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1785338294
OL,3,CExpectant mum 'shocked' at maternity
OL,4,Cunit closure
OL,6,FShe explained that North Devon
OL,7,FDistrict Hospital has had a "fragile
OL,8,Fmaternity service in terms of staffing
OL,9,Ffor a considerable time," but that the
OL,10,Funit has "tipped into a critical
OL,11,Fposition this summer due to unexpected
OL,12,Fabsence and sickness."
OL,14,FDr Purday said she could not give a
OL,15,Fdefinitive date for when the maternity
OL,16,Funit would reopen, but said work is
OL,17,Falready underway to improve
OL,18,Frecruitment.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1785338294
OL,3,CExpectant mum 'shocked' at maternity
OL,4,Cunit closure
OL,6,F"We'll be looking at what enhancements
OL,7,Fwe can make to those job adverts," she
OL,8,Fsaid. "We'll also be working with
OL,9,Fother organisations that face similar
OL,10,Fchallenges to consider what more we
OL,11,Fcan do."
OL,13,FThe trust said everyone who is 34
OL,14,Fweeks pregnant or more will be
OL,15,Freceiving a phone call in the next 10
OL,16,Fdays to discuss their birth plan.
OL,18,FThe trust added that it has set up a
OL,19,Fdedicated support helpline - 01271
OL,20,F335773 - which is open Monday-Friday,
OL,21,F9am-5pm.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
